{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "17d767caec5ae6ac0731f644c445a9d5ee12b78cda400216aeb860af92367468", "ja": "（紗代子たちが出演した映画『トゥインクルリズム』の\n宣伝のため、キャラクターショーが開催された！）", "zh": "（为了宣传纱代子她们出演的电影《闪耀节奏》，还举办了角色秀！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d9c09f440162f638962edd6478d0c995833eea93806a0593a07c9fcbbfb818ba", "ja": "紗代子、大丈夫だったか？　客席に降りてる間、\nずっと子どもたちに囲まれていたけど。", "zh": "纱代子，没事吧？下到观众席的时候，一直被孩子们围着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "0a483df809ea86d1f2309041921f6ff5919a74f2d2246b1d4db9002412a886a5", "ja": "はい！　ちょっとびっくりしましたけど、\nすごく嬉しかったです！", "zh": "是的！虽然有点吓了一跳，但我特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "386f22c6eb042ac4de613a22418d5bc0adfcbfd0794ebe37aa65de78aba8087c", "ja": "私の役、ネーゼは悪役なのに、あんなにたくさんの\n子どもたちに声をかけてもらえるなんて……！", "zh": "我的角色尼泽明明是反派，居然能得到那么多孩子主动搭话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1004_p", "source_sha256": "21f1017548e5d5960beb0d6b3c8aee7078e034b24523da699eda5d9d0a6a9eca", "ja": "悪役だけど、魅力的なキャラクターだからな。\nそれを紗代子がしっかり表現できてたんだろうな。", "zh": "虽然是反派，但毕竟是个很有魅力的角色。\n这份魅力，你一定表现得非常到位吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "0965a5b269302ee34522f476ab6f90fd3c88cd035f3bbb88e75b1553f3412fba", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　私は、とにかくみんなに楽しんで\n欲しくて、盛り上げるのに必死だっただけで……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我只是希望大家都能开心，为了活跃气氛拼尽全力而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1006_p", "source_sha256": "97c719c1d41609c9540eb4c10d59b73d7ab4ee505b1bdac2ccbbff697148c987", "ja": "うん、きっとそういう気持ちも、\n子どもたちに伝わったんだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，我想那样的心情一定也传达给孩子们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "0e51f38f89e8a9d4d863785392d9691f9dbcf679bf13f25e6140b83321441e22", "ja": "そっか……。ふふっ、じゃあ、よかったです！\n悪役だから、本当はダメなのかもしれないですけど。", "zh": "这样啊……呵呵，那太好了！\n虽然是反派，按理说可能不应该这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "7e3bd8ab09b4b432561433510c8954731455f660cce8d81af89aae06eb83d242", "ja": "ネーゼって、悪役なのにどこか憎めないっていうか。\n可愛いところも多くて、私も大好きなんです！", "zh": "尼泽明明是反派，却让人怎么都讨厌不起来。\n而且还有很多可爱的地方，我也最喜欢她了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "91865cbf7f6a536c3c2d616f2ea28a30fe06ce821666af6b9d897cf6865df1d8", "ja": "だから、みんなにもネーゼの魅力が伝わって、\n好きになってもらえたのなら……やっぱり嬉しいな。", "zh": "所以，如果大家也能感受到内泽的魅力，喜欢上她的话……我果然还是会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ac3a5cdfabec7363c6986ac7753ae1c140308606305d2696a61977ebe4863305", "ja": "きっと映画を見てもらえれば、\nもっと好きになってもらえるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "如果能让大家看看电影，说不定就会更加喜欢她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "2d0ab647fdda2b8453d8460e36b87f449734b4ecbe0600b1bd3531701dd9a60b", "ja": "そうなるといいなぁ～！　あ、でもネーゼだけじゃなく\nて、志保ちゃんのリーゼも、とっても可愛いんですよ！", "zh": "要是能那样就好了～！啊，不过不只是ネーゼ，\n志保的リーゼ也特别可爱哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "2ae8177bbc3d0be4ad9ae7476cfa1f3fb34e74965af7234804c8ed5a16018abe", "ja": "もちろん、育ちゃん達トゥインクルリズムが\n一番カッコよくて、可愛いんですけど♪", "zh": "当然还是育她们的Twinkle Rhythm最帅、最可爱啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1ba5a3da1a5d5ac25dd493215fcab859211b44c3a965040f530746f12621ac05", "ja": "ははっ、紗代子もすっかり\n『トゥインクルリズム』のファンだな！", "zh": "哈哈，纱代子也已经彻底成了《Twinkle Rhythm》的粉丝啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "d50ce5fab5377974be7c3fbae91d28eaa9a5b34dbac2c8d434f21b8449af7b5e", "ja": "はい！　……って、あれ？　今、客席で私……\nじゃなくて、ネーゼの名前、呼ばれてます？", "zh": "是！……咦？刚才，观众席那边喊的是我的名字……不对，是在喊ネーゼ的名字吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1015_p", "source_sha256": "91b9d47ca65c2635457d2f4e8bad0abad4146a2e32f3a9a761cef4c033e32954", "ja": "ん？　たしかに声が聞こえる……ああ、子どもたちか。\nみんな、もう一度ネーゼに会いたいんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯？确实能听到声音……啊，是小孩子们啊。\n大家肯定是想再见见涅泽吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "1be20eb85e581c299257252bfd37329737d7ddf8777ead7e6bc6132600451ebe", "ja": "……。あの、{$P$}！\nもう時間ですけど、ちょっとだけ……。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}！\n虽然已经到时间了，但能不能稍微去一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "656e7ba6cc72406bb16e2f24d6fb9557bb6e8e67fc0bcea869cc271b18202323", "ja": "ああ、話は通しておくから大丈夫だよ。\n子ども達に顔を見せてあげてきてくれ。", "zh": "啊，我会提前打好招呼的，没关系。\n你去让孩子们见见你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "f6fda0e17f724eccdc9e31b26042912ddfb918e5389a6961e4a4ce8dc41f916c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nじゃあ、行ってきますね♪", "zh": "谢谢您！\n那我这就去一趟哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0564_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "7647b127716ebc0c78acce3880a00aee3a2fb61c42f178448ad7b63a348a8096", "ja": "「あら、まだ私を呼ぶ子たちがいるみたいね！」", "zh": "“哎呀，好像还有孩子们在呼唤我呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
